# Component Rules

## Design source of truth
Before building any component, open the relevant design file in docs/design/components/.

| Building | Open |
|---|---|
| Any shared UI component | shared.jsx |
| Homepage, Browse | screens-1-2.jsx |
| Incident record, Oral histories index | screens-3-4.jsx |
| Mobile layouts | screens-5-6.jsx |
| Disputed accounts, Open incidents | screens-7-8.jsx |
| About, Submission, Contact, Privacy | screens-9-12.jsx |

## Types
All props typed using types from /types/index.ts. Import explicitly — no re-declaration.

## Strings
No hardcoded strings. All labels from /lib/constants.ts passed as props or imported directly.

## Responsive
- `lg` is the primary breakpoint (desktop above, mobile below)
- SiteHeader: `hidden lg:flex`
- BottomTabBar: `flex lg:hidden`
- Grids: single column mobile, multi-column at lg

## Fonts (Tailwind utilities)
- `font-serif` → EB Garamond
- `font-sans` → Source Sans 3
- `font-mono` → Space Mono

## Colors (Tailwind extensions — never raw hex)
bg-cream · text-charcoal · text-secondary · text-amber · bg-amber-light · text-amber-deep · border-rule · bg-annotation · bg-disputed · text-disputed · bg-closed · text-closed
